234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">54,486</text><text x="20" y="274" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#6b746c">Bars share one scale starting at 0; higher is better. Batches of 1,000.</text></svg></figure>
<div class="post-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Engine</th><th>customers, 8 loaders</th><th>orders, 1 loader</th><th>orders, 8 loaders</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><pre>SoliDB</pre></td><td><pre><strong>2,530,766</strong></pre></td><td><pre><strong>188,294</strong></pre></td><td><pre><strong>471,251</strong></pre></td></tr><tr><td><pre>PostgreSQL jsonb</pre></td><td><pre>1,233,684</pre></td><td><pre>97,536</pre></td><td><pre>302,399</pre></td></tr><tr><td><pre>PostgreSQL typed</pre></td><td><pre>1,334,961</pre></td><td><pre>87,440</pre></td><td><pre>278,838</pre></td></tr><tr><td><pre>MongoDB</pre></td><td><pre>735,998</pre></td><td><pre>104,696</pre></td><td><pre>227,521</pre></td></tr><tr><td><pre>ArangoDB</pre></td><td><pre>1,186,932</pre></td><td><pre>73,940</pre></td><td><pre>235,190</pre></td></tr><tr><td><pre>SurrealDB</pre></td><td><pre>747,782</pre></td><td><pre>31,401</pre></td><td><pre>54,486</pre></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</section>

<section id="get"><h2>One document by key</h2>
<p>The simplest request there is: one order by its key. It is also the one read where every client decodes into a generic JSON value rather than a struct, because SoliDB&rsquo;s client has no typed form of it.</p><p>At one client SoliDB answers in 15&nbsp;µs at the median, PostgreSQL typed in 18, PostgreSQL jsonb in 19, MongoDB in 31, ArangoDB in 32 and SurrealDB in 55. At 32 clients SoliDB serves 733,576 requests a second, 1.94 times PostgreSQL jsonb&rsquo;s 378,048, with a 99th percentile of 91&nbsp;µs against 279. It also spends less CPU on each: 6.5&nbsp;µs of server time per request, against 17 for PostgreSQL jsonb and 23 for MongoDB, measured from each container&rsquo;s cgroup.</p>
<figure class="post-figure"><svg viewBox="0 0 680 286" role="img" aria-labelledby="cmp-get-32-t"><title id="cmp-get-32-t">One order by key, 32 clients (requests per second)</title><text x="20" y="30" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#9ba39c">One order by key, 32 clients (requests per second)</text><line x1="170" y1="44" x2="170" y2="246" stroke="#29322f"/><text x="20" y="64" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">SoliDB</text><rect x="170" y="48" width="400" height="22" rx="3" fill="#f5a623"/><text x="578" y="64" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">733,576</text><text x="20" y="98" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">PostgreSQL jsonb</text><rect x="170" y="82" width="206" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="384" y="98" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">378,048</text><text x="20" y="132" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">PostgreSQL typed</text><rect x="170" y="116" width="193" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="371" y="132" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">354,434</text><text x="20" y="166" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">MongoDB</text><rect x="170" y="150" width="164" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="342" y="166" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">301,150</text><text x="20" y="200" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">ArangoDB</text><rect x="170" y="184" width="129" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="307" y="200" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">236,629</text><text x="20" y="234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">SurrealDB</text><rect x="170" y="218" width="40" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="218" y="234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">73,585</text><text x="20" y="274" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#6b746c">Bars share one scale starting at 0; higher is better. 1M orders, warm cache.</text></svg></figure>
