</section>

<section id="index"><h2>Rows found through an index</h2>
<p>Two reads through a secondary index. <em>by_customer</em> fetches every order of one customer, about ten rows, through the index on <code>customer_id</code>. <em>recent</em> takes a one-day window of <code>created_at</code>, about 1,370 orders, and returns the 20 most recent, which an engine can answer by walking the index backwards and stopping at 20.</p><p>For one customer&rsquo;s orders SoliDB answers in 39&nbsp;µs at one client, PostgreSQL typed in 43 and PostgreSQL jsonb in 45; at 32 clients it serves 220,404 a second against PostgreSQL jsonb&rsquo;s 177,403. For the 20 most recent orders the gap is wider: 67&nbsp;µs against PostgreSQL typed&rsquo;s 85 and MongoDB&rsquo;s 106, and 113,629 a second at 32 clients against 68,265. On both reads SoliDB sends each row by copying its stored MessagePack into the response, without decoding the document on the server.</p>
<figure class="post-figure"><svg viewBox="0 0 680 286" role="img" aria-labelledby="cmp-by_customer-1-t"><title id="cmp-by_customer-1-t">Every order of a customer, one client (median latency)</title><text x="20" y="30" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#9ba39c">Every order of a customer, one client (median latency)</text><line x1="170" y1="44" x2="170" y2="246" stroke="#29322f"/><text x="20" y="64" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">SoliDB</text><rect x="170" y="48" width="48" height="22" rx="3" fill="#f5a623"/><text x="226" y="64" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">39 µs</text><text x="20" y="98" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">PostgreSQL jsonb</text><rect x="170" y="82" width="56" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="234" y="98" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">45 µs</text><text x="20" y="132" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">PostgreSQL typed</text><rect x="170" y="116" width="53" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="231" y="132" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">43 µs</text><text x="20" y="166" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">MongoDB</text><rect x="170" y="150" width="80" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="258" y="166" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">65 µs</text><text x="20" y="200" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">ArangoDB</text><rect x="170" y="184" width="138" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="316" y="200" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">112 µs</text><text x="20" y="234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">SurrealDB</text><rect x="170" y="218" width="400" height="22" rx="3" fill="#6b746c"/><text x="578" y="234" font-family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">324 µs</text><text x="20" y="274" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#6b746c">Bars share one scale starting at 0; lower is better. 1M orders, warm cache.</text></svg></figure>
