family="JetBrains Mono, monospace" font-size="12" fill="#ece6d6">613 µs</text><text x="20" y="274" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#6b746c">Bars share one scale starting at 0; lower is better. 1M orders, warm cache.</text></svg></figure>
